{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/CaveDriving.gif?t=1742922476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nylos is a <strong> puzzle </strong>platformer that takes players through diverse environments\u2013from lush caves to floating islands and high-tech labs.<br><br>The game introduces a <strong>variety</strong> <strong>of unique powers</strong> that you can <strong>combine</strong> in creative ways to solve puzzles and explore every corner of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/LovePower.gif?t=1742922476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nylos</strong>, a test subject in Dr. Solomon\u2019s AI lab, embarks on a journey to prove himself \u2014 joined by his quirky companion, <strong>Tiko</strong>, who helps, jokes, and keeps things lively as they uncover the lab\u2019s hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/TikoTalking.gif?t=1742922476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level offers <strong>multiple ways to solve puzzles</strong>, encouraging players to experiment and find <strong>creative and personal paths</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/extras/PullingMushroom.gif?t=1742922476\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517920?t=1742922476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517920/6a476e25e8d765793cd63833ac08d232d7bf1290/page_bg_ra